  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-07-08T11:06:16.752Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hi!I wanted to discuss the recent change regarding username updates, which now require a 90-day waiting period. This length of time feels quite long, especially if someone accidentally makes a mistake with their new name. \n\nIf you do mess up, your only option is to revert back to your previous username and then wait another 90 days just to correct a typo. Is there any possibility of shortening this waiting period? Perhaps allowing two name changes every 90 days could help? \n\nIt might also make sense to consider this as a feature for VRC+ users. I really hope something can be done about this because my friends and I are finding it quite frustrating. \n\nThanks! Goodbye!",
